\b\fs24 Backend answer path\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  generate_response(text, history=None, timeout=60) POSTs JSON \{message, history\} to BACKEND_URL.rstrip("/") + "/chat".\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  Message is capped at 12,000 characters; outgoing history is bounded to the last eight entries.\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  Expects a non-empty JSON reply.\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  Handles HTTP errors, network/timeouts, OS errors and JSON/type/value problems with user-facing fallback messages.\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  Current desktop source contains no GROQ_API_KEY, GROQ_MODEL, GEMINI_API_KEY, GEMINI_MODEL, scikit-learn import or provider SDK. Do not claim direct Groq/Gemini calls. Provider setup would need to be verified in the backend source/configuration.\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  Local analyze_text() does not generate an offline answer. Current desktop answer path depends on remote backend availability.\b0\fs20\par
