\b\fs24 CSV, history and GUI\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  append_chat() calls NLP defensively and writes timestamp, user, bot, tokens, keywords, intent, question type and sentiment to CSV. It attempts to migrate old CSV headers.\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  read_history() reads CSV rows; add_turn() adds user/model turns and keeps the last 12 context items.\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  Tkinter window title: CampusBot - AI Chatbot; geometry 850\u215?680; minimum 560\u215?460.\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  GUI has scrollable chat, input, Send, Clear conversation, Show saved history, status and a reminder not to enter passwords/API keys.\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  Enter submits; Send is disabled while busy. Clear clears in-memory context but retains CSV history. History view shows latest ten exchanges.\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  Worker thread makes request; queue + root.after(100, self.poll) updates UI.\b0\fs20\par
\u8226?  append_chat() catches NLP errors and uses safe neutral metadata. Background caller catches history-writing errors so a valid reply should not be discarded. Direct file operations can still raise on I/O failure, so test these paths.\b0\fs20\par
